Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@29||-27|29|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S[*==============================,* DFF Testbench (2-phase TG Master-Slave),*==============================,*--- Supply,VDD  VDD  0   DC 1.8,*--- Data input (D),"* period = 40ns, high time = 20ns",VD   d    0   PULSE(0 1.8 5n 100p 100p 20n 40n),*--- Two-phase clocks (non-overlap بسيط بإزاحة 200ps),* ph1 high for 10ns every 20ns,VPH1   ph1   0   PULSE(0   1.8  0n     100p 100p 10n 20n),VPH1B  ph1b  0   PULSE(1.8 0    0n     100p 100p 10n 20n),* ph2 is complementary but shifted by 200ps to reduce overlap risk,VPH2   ph2   0   PULSE(1.8 0    200p   100p 100p 10n 20n),VPH2B  ph2b  0   PULSE(0   1.8  200p   100p 100p 10n 20n),*--- Output load on Q,Cload q 0 10f,*--- Include transistor models (عدّلي المسار إذا لازم),".include \"C:\\Users\\e-life center\\Desktop\\donia","\\C5_models.txt\"",*==============================,* Measurements,*==============================,* clk->Q delay (اعتبرت تحديث Q مرتبط بفتح الـ slave = ph1 rising),.measure tran t_clkq_rise  trig v(ph1) val=0.9 rise=1  targ v(q) val=0.9 rise=1,.measure tran t_clkq_fall  trig v(ph1) val=0.9 rise=1  targ v(q) val=0.9 fall=1,* Q rise/fall times (10%-90% و 90%-10%),.measure tran tr_q  trig v(q) val=0.18 rise=1 targ v(q) val=1.62 rise=1,.measure tran tf_q  trig v(q) val=1.62 fall=1 targ v(q) val=0.18 fall=1,* Average power from VDD over steady window (مثال من 40ns لـ 120ns),.measure tran Iavg_VDD AVG I(VDD) FROM=40n TO=120n,.measure tran Pavg_VDD PARAM='1.8*Iavg_VDD',*==============================,.measure tran t_clkq_rise  trig v(ph1) val=0.9 rise=1  targ v(q) val=0.9 rise=1,.measure tran t_clkq_fall  trig v(ph1) val=0.9 rise=1  targ v(q) val=0.9 fall=1,* Simulation,*==============================,.tran 0 150n,.options plotwinsize=0,.end]
